$bog_vmap_app_palette $mol_view
	pack? \https://mol.hyoo.ru
	query? \
	selected? \
	- Narrow layout for a side panel of the editor: header in a column, ports pane
	- dropped. A port row is an 11rem signature plus a value plus an owner badge and
	- does not fit a panel; the ports of a node picked on the canvas belong to the
	- inspector of 2.6 anyway, which is a different question from «what can I add».
	compact false
	- Class the pointer is currently carrying, empty when nothing is being dragged,
	- and where the pointer is right now in viewport coordinates. Started here on
	- `pointerdown`, moved and cleared by whoever owns the canvas: the palette knows
	- when a drag begins and nothing about where it ends.
	dragged? \
	drag_x? 0
	drag_y? 0
	attr *
		^
		bog_vmap_app_palette_compact <= compact
	sub <= body /$mol_view
	-
	Head $mol_bar
		sub /
			<= Brand $mol_view sub / \Палитра
			<= Pack $mol_string
				hint \Адрес пака
				value? <=> pack?
			<= Query $mol_string
				hint \Поиск по имени
				value? <=> query?
			<= Total $mol_view sub / <= total \
	-
	Body $mol_view
		sub <= body_content /$mol_view
	-
	Classes $mol_scroll
		sub /
			<= Class_list $mol_list
				rows <= class_rows /
	-
	- `$mol_scroll` is a grid that puts every child into cell 1/1, so it holds
	- exactly one node. The heading has to live beside it, not in it.
	Ports $mol_view
		sub /
			<= Ports_head $mol_view
				sub /
					<= Selected $mol_view sub / <= selected_title \
					<= Chain $mol_view sub / <= chain_title \
			<= Ports_scroll $mol_scroll
				sub /
					<= Port_list $mol_list
						rows <= port_rows /
	-
	- One button per class. `$mol_list` renders only what is on screen, so all
	- 449 of them cost nothing until scrolled to.
	Class_row* $bog_vmap_app_palette_item
		title <= class_title* \
		click? <=> class_click*? null
		current <= class_current* false
		drag_start? <=> class_drag*? null
	-
	Port_row* $bog_vmap_app_palette_port
		sign <= port_sign* \
		body <= port_body* \
		owner <= port_owner* \
		inherited <= port_inherited* false
	-
	- The model. `pack` is wired one way: the field above is the only place it is
	- written, and the library derives both of its addresses from it.
	Lib $bog_vmap_lib
		pack <= pack
